{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2021-12-13 17:55:00', 'title': 'VICI PROPERTIES INC. ENTERS INTO AGREEMENTS RELATING TO THE MIRAGE HOTEL & CASINO IN LAS VEGAS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VICI PROPERTIES INC. (NYSE: VICI) (“VICI PROPERTIES” OR “VICI” OR THE “COMPANY”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT, IN CONNECTION WITH MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL'S (“MGM RESORTS”) (NYSE: MGM) AGREEMENT TO SELL THE OPERATIONS OF THE MIRAGE HOTEL & CASINO (THE “MIRAGE”), LOCATED IN LAS VEGAS, NV, TO HARD ROCK INTERNATIONAL (“HARD ROCK”), VICI HAS AGREED TO ENTER INTO A NEW SEPARATE LEASE WITH HARD ROCK RELATED TO THE OPERATIONS OF THE MIRAGE (THE “MIRAGE LEASE”) AND ALSO ENTER IN"}{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2021-12-13 17:45:00', 'title': 'MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL ANNOUNCES AGREEMENT TO SELL OPERATIONS OF THE MIRAGE FOR $1.075 BILLION', 'text': 'LAS VEGAS, DEC. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL ("MGM RESORTS" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: MGM) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS REACHED AN AGREEMENT TO SELL THE OPERATIONS OF THE MIRAGE HOTEL & CASINO ("THE MIRAGE") TO HARD ROCK INTERNATIONAL ("HARD ROCK") FOR $1.075 BILLION IN CASH, SUBJECT TO CUSTOMARY WORKING CAPITAL ADJUSTMENTS. "THIS TRANSACTION IS A SIGNIFICANT MILESTONE FOR MGM RESORTS, AND FOR LAS VEGAS," SAID BILL HORNBUCKLE, CEO & PRESIDENT, MGM RESORTS INTERNATIONAL.'}